ent [hidden]{display:none!important}\n@media(max-width:760px){\n .xl-lesson>header{margin:10px 10px 0;padding:22px 20px 16px;border-radius:19px}.xl-lesson>main{margin:14px 10px 60px;padding:0}\n .xl-lesson>header nav{gap:6px}.xl-lesson>header nav button{font-size:16px;padding:10px}\n .xl-chapter,.xl-opening,.xl-method-step,.xl-lab-guide,.xl-lesson .card,.xl-lesson .panel,.xl-lesson .plot-grid>article,.xl-lesson .reading-block{padding:20px 18px;border-radius:17px}\n .xl-opening h2{font-size:23px}.xl-reading-path{grid-template-columns:1fr}.xl-products{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n .xl-lesson .charts,.xl-lesson .maps,.xl-lesson .split,.xl-lesson .workspace,.xl-lesson .two-columns,.xl-lesson .plot-grid,.xl-lesson .analysis{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important;gap:18px}\n .xl-lesson .controls,.xl-lesson .controlgrid,.xl-lesson .control-grid,.xl-lesson .condition-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}\n .xl-lesson .metric,.xl-lesson .metrics,.xl-lesson .strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));flex-wrap:wrap}\n .xl-step-heading{display:block}.xl-step-heading h3{margin-top:8px}.xl-step-nav{gap:6px}.xl-step-nav button{font-size:15px;padding:9px 11px}\n .xl-lesson .charts figure{padding:7px}.xl-lesson .chart,.xl-lesson .plot,.xl-lesson .chart-shell,.xl-lesson .svg-frame{max-width:100%;overflow:auto}\n .xl-knowledge svg,.xl-method-step svg{max-height:240px}.xl-method .case-flow-overview{padding:10px;overflow:auto}.xl-method .case-flow-overview svg{min-width:650px}\n .xl-diagram svg{min-width:680px;max-height:none}.xl-data-plot>svg,.xl-data-plot>canvas{min-width:760px;max-width:none!important;width:760px!important;height:auto}\n .xl-diagram-hint{display:block;position:sticky;left:0;font-size:14px;color:#867476;line-height:1.8;padding:6px 0 2px}\n .xl-lesson .action-row,.xl-lesson .actions,.xl-lesson .bottom-actions{flex-wrap:wrap}.xl-lesson .view-tools{flex-wrap:wrap}\n}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.xl-lesson *,.xl-parent *{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style><div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>把流动与携屑需求对应到流变响应，读出黏度变化的含义。</p><p>钻井液循环把钻屑带回地面。流动行为与黏度有关，但密度、携屑能力和静止时悬浮能力是不同性质。本页围绕塑性黏度PV，比较配方和温度怎样改变流变斜率。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"宾汉流变模型\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">剪切应力 τ / Pa</text><path d=\"M85.0 55V240M85 240.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">0</text><path d=\"M243.75 55V240M85 193.75H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"243.75\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">250</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"198.75\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">15</text><path d=\"M402.5 55V240M85 147.5H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">500</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"152.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">30</text><path d=\"M561.25 55V240M85 101.25H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"561.25\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">750</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"106.25\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">45</text><path d=\"M720.0 55V240M85 55.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"720.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">1000</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">60</text><path d=\"M85.00,224.58L243.75,209.17L402.50,193.75L561.25,178.33L720.00,162.92\" stroke=\"#14796f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14796f\">YP=5 Pa，PV=20 mPa·s</text><path d=\"M85.00,224.58L243.75,186.04L402.50,147.50L561.25,108.96L720.00,70.42\" stroke=\"#c07648\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#c07648\">YP=5 Pa，PV=50 mPa·s</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">剪切速率 γ̇ / s⁻¹</text></svg><figcaption>图B1｜PV就是流变直线斜率。两条线截距相同，斜率不同。20 mPa·s=0.020 Pa·s，因此剪切速率增加500 s⁻¹时，应力增加10 Pa；YP仍为5 Pa。</figcaption></figure></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "PRINCIPLE",
          "title": "PV是流变曲线中的一个斜率",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>在剪切速率—应力图上读斜率，理解PV的含义。</p><p>宾汉模型写作τ=YP+PV·γ̇。YP是外推截距，PV是高剪切区斜率。τ用Pa、γ̇用s⁻¹时PV用Pa·s；本例输出mPa·s，1 mPa·s=0.001 Pa·s。固相体积分数%、聚合物浓度g/100mL和温度共同改变教学响应。</p><figure><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"固定固相6%的响应\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"#fafcf9\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"25\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#243740\">教学 PV / mPa·s</text><path d=\"M85.0 55V240M85 240.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.1</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"245.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">10</text><path d=\"M243.75 55V240M85 193.75H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"243.75\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.45</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"198.75\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">17.5</text><path d=\"M402.5 55V240M85 147.5H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"402.5\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">0.8</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"152.5\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">25</text><path d=\"M561.25 55V240M85 101.25H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"561.25\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">1.15</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"106.25\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">32.5</text><path d=\"M720.0 55V240M85 55.0H720\" stroke=\"#dce5dd\"/><text x=\"720.0\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">1.5</text><text x=\"73\" y=\"60.0\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#243740\">40</text><path d=\"M85.00,187.88L243.75,166.02L402.50,144.17L561.25,122.32L720.00,100.46\" stroke=\"#14796f\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#14796f\">25℃</text><path d=\"M85.00,218.17L243.75,189.03L402.50,159.90L561.25,130.76L720.00,101.62\" stroke=\"#c07648\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"305\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#c07648\">100℃</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"283\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#243740\">聚合物浓度 / % (g/100 mL)</text></svg><figcaption>图B2｜固定固相后的温度—剂量响应。使用演示的同一教学响应函数；温度与聚合物存在交互，所以高温线斜率更大。曲线展示本例配方假设下温度与聚合物的交互。</figcaption></figure></div>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "INTERPRETATION",
          "title": "先检验预测，再搜索配方",
          "html": "<div class=\"xl-knowledge\"><p class=\"xl-read\"><b>看图时留意</b>先比较独立样本的预测误差，再查看满足目标范围的配方。</p><p>用140个教学实验批次拟合非线性响应，用70个独立批次检查预测误差。随后才在给定温度和PV范围内扫描候选，并将目标偏差与相对成本综合排序。</p><p>候选数量反映目标区间与约束共同留下的配方空间。</p><p class=\"sub\">专业资料：<a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/p/plastic_viscosity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLB｜Plastic viscosity</a>；<a href=\"https://glossary.slb.com/en/terms/b/bingham_plastic_model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLB｜Bingham plastic model</a>。本例采用固定种子教学数据；数据结构、单位与评价范围在演示中列出。</p><aside class=\"learning-task\"><h3>先做一个可核对实验</h3><p>温度从25调至125℃，重算后看同一固相曲线的斜率与可行候选数量；把PV下限设45、上限设20，观察无可行候选。根据冲突的上下限解释空集合，再恢复有效目标区间比较。</p></aside></div>"
        }
      ],
      "lessonOpening": "<div class=\"xl-opening\"><span class=\"xl-kicker\">认识问题 · 再看方法</span><h2>钻井液性能取决于配方和温度；配方搜索应建立在已检验的性能预测上。</h2><p>从一个钻井液配方候选出发，把专业含义、图中位置和计算结果连起来。</p><div class=\"xl-reading-path\"><a href=\"#xl-chapter-0\" data-xl-chapter=\"0\"><span>01</span>钻井液不仅要流动，还要携屑</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-1\" data-xl-chapter=\"1\"><span>02</span>PV是流变曲线中的一个斜率</a><a href=\"#xl-chapter-2\" data-xl-chapter=\"2\"><span>03</span>先检验预测，再搜索配方</a></div></div>"
    },
    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "温度变了，固相和聚合物剂量如何共同影响塑性黏度？",
      "lead": [
        "温度变了，固相和聚合物剂量如何共同影响塑性黏度？",
        "按下列手算例理解运算，再进入示范改变同一数据上的模型和基线。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        [
          "步骤",
          "3"
        ],
        [
          "运行",
          "离线"
        ]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "分开实验批次",
          "role": "步骤1",
          "do": "140批拟合，70批独立评价。",
          "effect": "批次RMSE",
          "trap": "噪声控件改变留出批次的测量扰动。"
        },
        {
          "name": "建立流变响应面",
          "role": "步骤2",
          "do": "拟合固相、剂量、温度及平方/交互项。",
          "effect": "多项式系数与经验基线",
          "trap": "在本例配方与温度范围内读取响应面。"
        },
        {
          "name": "搜索可行配方",
          "role": "步骤3",
          "do": "扫描剂量和固相网格，筛选PV范围再排序。",
